    "title": "Optimising conversion without compromising luxury",
    "client": "Exceptional design, seamless collaboration.",
    "tags": [],
    "logo": "",
    "featured_image": "",
    "prose_html": "<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"0\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Mockup of Wilderness website design.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/Wilderness-1.jpg\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"1\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"client\">Client</h3><p> Wilderness Safaris offers premium travel to some of the world’s most remote and breathtaking locations. They combine raw, natural experiences with all the comfort and luxury travellers could want. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"results\">Results</h2><div class=\"gradient-border lexical-stats\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\"> <div class=\"grid inner\" data-astro-cid-fxdehnn2=\"true\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\" style=\"--grid-min:12rem;undefined\"> <div class=\"lexical-stats__item\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\"> <span class=\"lexical-stats__value\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\">+144%</span> <span class=\"lexical-stats__label\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\">increase in enquiry rate</span> </div><div class=\"lexical-stats__item\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\"> <span class=\"lexical-stats__value\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\">-46%</span> <span class=\"lexical-stats__label\" data-astro-cid-opkcwzie=\"\">reduction in cost per acquisition</span> </div> </div> </div> <h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"challenge\">Challenge</h2><p> Despite a beautifully designed website that reflected the brand’s luxury positioning, paid media campaigns were costing far too much. The site wasn’t converting visitors into enquiries efficiently, resulting in an unsustainable cost per acquisition. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"approach\">Approach</h2><p> We redesigned user journeys across the site to make them smoother and more intuitive. Stunning visuals and clear layouts guided visitors naturally, presenting calls to action at the right moments - all while maintaining the brand’s luxurious look and feel. </p><p> </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"2\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Mockup of itinerary from Wilderness website design.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/wilderness-2.jpg\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section CalloutTextBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"3\" data-pb=\"none\" data-pt=\"lg\" data-size=\"4\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" style=\"--prose-font-size: var(--font-size-4)\"><p> Striking the right balance between visual appeal and results </p></div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"4\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"action\">Action</h2><p> We redesigned user journeys across the site to make them smoother and more intuitive. Stunning visuals and clear layouts guided visitors naturally, presenting calls to action at the right moments - all while maintaining the brand’s luxurious look and feel. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"outcome\">Outcome</h2><p> The new website delivered impressive results: visitors could now easily enquire, supported by clear messaging, visuals, and a seamless experience. </p><div class=\"LexicalTeamBlock\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <h3 data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Project leads</h3> <ul class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\" data-justify=\"start\"> <div class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"sm\" data-justify=\"start\" data-nowrap=\"\"> <div class=\"Avatar gradient-border\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <div class=\"frame inner\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:1/1;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Portrait of Toby.\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=1600,height=1600,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/Toby.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div> </div> <p data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Toby Felton</p> </div> <div class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"sm\" data-justify=\"start\" data-nowrap=\"\"> <div class=\"Avatar gradient-border\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <div class=\"frame inner\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:1/1;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Portrait of Josh.\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=1600,height=1600,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/Josh.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div> </div> <p data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Josh Trim</p> </div> </ul> </div> <p> </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"5\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Mockup of Wilderness website design.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/wilderness-3.jpg\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>"
