  "bbd-boom": {
    "title": "Fully integrated design support for a high-volume Hubspot agency",
    "client": "Exceptional design, seamless collaboration.",
    "tags": [],
    "logo": "",
    "featured_image": "",
    "prose_html": "<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"0\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Composition of BBD Boom screens.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/BBD Comp 3-1.png\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"1\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"client\">Client</h3><p> BBD Boom helps businesses get more from HubSpot through tailored CRM strategies and bespoke implementation. As a highly accredited partner, they work with organisations across a range of sectors, supporting teams to use the platform in a way that genuinely fits how they operate. Alongside delivery, they share practical insight and thought leadership to help their clients build confidence and get lasting value from HubSpot. </p><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"results\">Results</h3><div class=\"gradient-border lexical-callout\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"\"> <div class=\"inner\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"true\"><p> BBD Boom produces a high volume of content, from marketing assets and thought leadership to events. Using our flexible, credit-based design support, they’ve been able to build real momentum and sustain a level of output that wasn’t previously possible.<br/><br/>Projects now move from brief to completion in a matter of days, freeing up internal resource and giving the marketing team more capacity to focus on what matters most. </p></div> </div> </div> <h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"challenge\">Challenge</h3><p> BBD Boom wanted to level up their marketing and increase their output of insightful content, but limited resource and capacity were holding them back. Projects often sat in a queue, slowing momentum and reducing flexibility.<br/>Hiring an in-house designer felt like a costly option, and in reality, BBD Boom needed access to a broader creative skillset. </p><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"approach\">Approach</h3><p> The approach was simple: use flexible design support to tap into the expertise of an entire creative team. Working through a streamlined, credit-based system, the process reduces admin and keeps everything moving efficiently.<br/>All of this is managed through an intuitive dashboard, where tasks are tracked and everyone has clear visibility. </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"2\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"BBD Boom screen composition 2.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/BBD Comp 2-1.png\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section CalloutTextBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"3\" data-pb=\"none\" data-pt=\"lg\" data-size=\"4\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" style=\"--prose-font-size: var(--font-size-4)\"><p> With flexible, credit-based design support, BBD Boom turned bottlenecks into momentum - delivering content faster, freeing internal resources, and unlocking a wider creative skillset without extra hires. </p></div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"4\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"action\">Action</h3><p> With a clear, straightforward process, stakeholders at BBD Boom can speak directly to the designers - no more endless Teams calls or miscommunications.<br/>Even better, while BBD Boom has a dedicated design contact, tasks are handled by a full creative team with expertise across all aspects of design. </p><h3 data-align=\"\" id=\"outcome\">Outcome</h3><p> The results speak for themselves: 170 projects in just 18 months. No burnt-out internal designers, no dip in quality - just consistent, efficient, and considered design.<br/>It’s a relationship where Akshara Digital has fully integrated as an extension of the BBD Boom team - always on hand, exactly when needed. </p><blockquote class=\"gradient-border lexical-testimonial\" data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"\" data-size=\"md\" data-text-align=\"left\"> <div class=\"inner\" data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"true\"><p> Akshara Digital’s Flexi Design package has transformed our creative workflow at BBD Boom - briefs move seamlessly, turnarounds are rapid, and the output is consistently on-brand and studio-quality. Their flexibility means they fit in wherever we need them, helping us scale campaigns without sacrificing quality or deadlines. </p></div> <footer class=\"lexical-testimonial__attribution\" data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"\"> <cite data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"\">Emily Allen<span class=\"lexical-testimonial__company\" data-astro-cid-3kyj2g77=\"\"> — Digital Marketing Executive</span></cite> </footer> </div> </blockquote> <p> </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"5\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><div class=\"LexicalTeamBlock\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <h3 data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Project leads</h3> <ul class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\" data-justify=\"start\"> <div class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"sm\" data-justify=\"start\" data-nowrap=\"\"> <div class=\"Avatar gradient-border\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <div class=\"frame inner\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:1/1;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Portrait of Navneet.\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=1600,height=1600,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/Navneet.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div> </div> <p data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Navneet Pongpiriyaporn</p> </div> <div class=\"cluster\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nnjvwa65=\"true\" data-gap=\"sm\" data-justify=\"start\" data-nowrap=\"\"> <div class=\"Avatar gradient-border\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\"> <div class=\"frame inner\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:1/1;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Portrait of Toby.\" data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=1600,height=1600,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/Toby.jpg\" width=\"1600\"/> </div> </div> <p data-astro-cid-hvxffu6y=\"\">Toby Felton</p> </div> </ul> </div> <p> </p><p> </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"6\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"A composition of BBD Boom screens 1.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/BBD Comp 1-1.png\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>"
