    "prose_html": "<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"0\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Mockup of SRC website design.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/SRC Comp 1.jpg\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"1\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"client\">Client</h2><p> Solent Rib Charter operate a number of water-based businesses across the UK and Europe. Their sub-brand sites needed a refresh, while maintaining a consistent look and feel. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"results\">Results</h2><div class=\"gradient-border lexical-callout\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"\"> <div class=\"inner\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-xhpczfc3=\"true\"><ul><li>Drastically reduced time required to deliver distinct webpages</li><li>Increased responsiveness and performance across devices</li></ul></div> </div> </div> <h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"challenge\">Challenge</h2><p> Each sub-brand had unique requirements, so the challenge  was to design versatile page sections that could adapt to varying content. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"approach\">Approach</h2><p> Breaking key pages into modular components allowed us to build a shared design system. With each brand’s styling applied, the experience remained recognisable, consistent, and cohesive. </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section MediaBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"2\" data-width=\"wide\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\"> <div class=\"frame image\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" data-astro-cid-eyh4dltn=\"true\" style=\"--frame-ratio:4/3;--frame-pos:center;undefined\"> <img alt=\"Mockup of SRC website design.\" data-astro-cid-bavvqtwf=\"true\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"1800\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://salo.uk/cdn-cgi/image/onerror=redirect,width=2400,height=1800,quality=80,format=webp/https://media.salo.uk/salo-website-prod/SRC Comp 2.jpg\" width=\"2400\"/> </div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section CalloutTextBlock\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-index=\"3\" data-pb=\"lg\" data-pt=\"lg\" data-size=\"4\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-iznjqojv=\"true\" style=\"--prose-font-size: var(--font-size-4)\"><p> Five sites, one component library, endless variations </p></div> </div> </section>\n<section class=\"section TextBlock text-left\" data-align=\"center\" data-astro-cid-nzplicgg=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-index=\"4\" data-padding=\"lg\" data-text-align=\"left\" data-width=\"default\"> <div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-advsmqsh=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"> <div class=\"stack content\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"md\"> <div class=\"stack\" data-astro-cid-jem6suqm=\"true\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\" data-gap=\"lg\"> <div class=\"prose\" data-astro-cid-wqwikenp=\"true\"><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"action\">Action</h2><p> Throughout the design process, we were careful that our components didn’t restrict layouts or make the sites feel repetitive. Instead, we designed a range of customisable features to ensure each section felt distinct. </p><h2 data-align=\"\" id=\"outcome\">Outcome</h2><p> Our library of around 30 sections enabled us to efficiently create key page templates across five sites. This modular approach carried through to the build, providing complete flexibility for the platforms to scale alongside rapid growth. </p></div> </div> </div> </div> </section>"
  }
}